== Effects ==
* Spawns a familiar who follows Isaac and picks up coins on the ground.
* After picking up 6 coins, Bum Friend will return to Isaac and drop a pickup.
* After that, Bum Friend has a 67% chance to drop a pickup after picking up 3 coins and a 33% chance to drop a pickup after picking up 4 coins.
* {{transformation contribution|Super Bum}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a}} Bum Friend cannot pick up {{e|Sticky Nickel}}s.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|a}} Bum Friend can pick up {{e|Lucky Penny|text=Lucky Pennies}}, but it will simply count as a regular Penny and will not grant [[luck]].{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|anr}} From a scoring perspective, Pennies that Bum Friend picks up count towards your [[Schwag bonus]] on daily runs.{{dlc-}}
* Bum Friend does not join the line of familiars that follow behind Isaac.
* Not recommended for {{c|Keeper}} as it will make it harder to regain health due to the Keeper healing via coins.

== Drops ==
* Bum Friend can drop:
** {{e|Red Heart}}s
** {{e|Bomb}}s
** {{e|Key}}s
** [[Cards and Runes]]
** [[Pill]]s
** [[Trinket]]s
** {{dlc|r}} {{E|Lil' Battery|text=Lil' Batteries}}
** {{dlc|r}} [[Item]]s from the {{ip|Beggar|text=Beggar item pool}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: All future drops will happen every 3 coins. If the next scheduled drop at the moment of acquiring BFFS! requires more than 3 coins, the amount will not be lowered.
* {{i|Mitre}}: {{e|Red Heart}}s that Bum drops can be converted into {{e|Soul Heart}}s.
* {{I|Chaos|dlc=r}}: Bum Friend's item pedestals will be affected by Chaos, spawning an item from a random pool.

